WEBVTT

00:01:29.116 --> 00:01:31.196
run by the city of Oslo.

00:01:31.236 --> 00:01:37.396
And running zero-emission sites is just
one example of the Oslo climate strategy.

00:01:37.836 --> 00:01:43.636
This is how downtown of Oslo looked
when I moved to Oslo in 1989.

00:01:44.196 --> 00:01:46.596
This is the same area today.

00:01:47.236 --> 00:01:53.516
Oslo's climate measures have given
the city cleaner air, less noise,

00:01:53.556 --> 00:01:56.316
safer and more human-centered streets.

00:01:56.796 --> 00:02:00.676
Some of the measures were controversial
when first introduced,